 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Holy Emperor's Grandson Is a Necromancer"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "성황의 손자는 네크로맨서"
   },
   {
    "ko-ro": "Seonghwangui Sonjaneun Necromancer"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "After a near-death experience, something has changed about the Holy Emperor’s troublemaker of a grandson. To be precise, his body was taken over by a Korean man who died while playing a VR video game! \n\nBut when his necromancer character is mixed with a Holy Prince’s blood, things start getting funky. The zombies he makes are incredibly nice, his curses start healing people, and the girl he saved from being turned into a zombie suddenly gains super strength. \n\nNow he has to play the hero, but he’d really rather just go for a nap."
  },
